The S-Bahn stops at the next station.
I must get out here.
I get out quickly.
I walk down the stairs.
Down on the street I immediately see the water.
The river is very wide and calm.
I go to the bank.
I walk along the river.
Many brick buildings stand here.
The old houses look very beautiful.
I look at my phone.
It is ten minutes to six.
I must walk fast.
The small coffee roaster is near here.
I look for the right house number.
Then I see a small sign on a window.
I stand in front of the shop.
I breathe in deeply.
The smell of roasted beans is wonderful.
The scent of coffee comes right out onto the street.
